{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1792228741,"nonce":"qWGhq94CYNMEuR4njhuGY3wXO/w=","message":"Correction to the title as first filed: the panel was animated, by the user-agent stylesheet's dialog[open] and dialog[closing] rules (ashui-grow-in from scale(0), ashui-shrink-out), as DialogMotion's trace shows. What differed from the overlay family was the motion, not its absence. dialog.ui-dialog[open] and [closing] in components.css now use ui-rise-in and ui-rise-out, timed as ChimpMonk's patch times them, which a consumer can drop. tests/Components.hx checks the panel's animation on open and on close; it fails without the rules.","files":null}]}